{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01337",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 5.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I think it's my turn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.26,
      "end_seconds": 11.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 16.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.06,
      "end_seconds": 21.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.77,
      "end_seconds": 31.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "Okay, so I've been dealing with watery diarrhoea. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.19,
      "end_seconds": 37.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.82,
      "end_seconds": 52.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.02,
      "end_seconds": 74.06,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 72, pulse 92. And SpO2 98 percent on room air, respiratory rate 19. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.67,
      "end_seconds": 82.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "So, about three days, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 83.35,
      "end_seconds": 88.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Mm, hm, I'd say more like five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.24,
      "end_seconds": 93.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.92,
      "end_seconds": 96.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Yes, somewhere around that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.57,
      "end_seconds": 101.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.93,
      "end_seconds": 110.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Erm, uh, honestly, every other day. I'd say mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.7,
      "end_seconds": 115.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.08,
      "end_seconds": 127.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "A low fever goes along with it, most of the time. The low fever? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.95,
      "end_seconds": 132.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Have you had any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.55,
      "end_seconds": 134.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "No vomiting, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.76,
      "end_seconds": 139.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Have you noticed severe dehydration or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.41,
      "end_seconds": 145.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Actually, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.76,
      "end_seconds": 150.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.85,
      "end_seconds": 154.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Um, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.75,
      "end_seconds": 160.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.26,
      "end_seconds": 164.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.67,
      "end_seconds": 184.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.63,
      "end_seconds": 193.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "I had my appendix taken out when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.16,
      "end_seconds": 210.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.78,
      "end_seconds": 216.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.47,
      "end_seconds": 223.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.01,
      "end_seconds": 227.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.86,
      "end_seconds": 231.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Right, do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.82,
      "end_seconds": 237.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.88,
      "end_seconds": 253.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.98,
      "end_seconds": 259.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "No, uh, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.83,
      "end_seconds": 263.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.92,
      "end_seconds": 267.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.27,
      "end_seconds": 284.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild general tenderness and your mouth is a little dry."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.27,
      "end_seconds": 295.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.63,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? My working impression is travellers' diarrhoea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.03,
      "end_seconds": 299.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.12,
      "end_seconds": 320.81,
      "duration_seconds": 19.69,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's travellers' diarrhoea, and we'll know more once the a stool sample is back. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had watery diarrhoea, mild, and no blood in the stool or severe dehydration."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.0,
      "end_seconds": 324.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.69,
      "end_seconds": 336.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "I'll request a stool sample, it'll help with diarrhoea after travel. Drink plenty of fluids and wash your hands carefully. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.32,
      "end_seconds": 341.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Oh, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.88,
      "end_seconds": 344.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}